    "short_description": "Interwoven Emotions is a narrative puzzle game where you follow the characters to fight negative emotions and find purpose. Do you have what it takes to defeat the fire rage throws at you, navigate the maze of sadness, or ability to pick up the pieces when insecurity has you down? Let\u2019s find out\u2026",
